WEBVTT

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:01.505
An older parent.

00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:02.781
A new baby.

00:00:03.049 --> 00:00:04.662
Recovery after surgery.

00:00:04.982 --> 00:00:06.544
Care changes every day.

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:08.141
The appointment moved.

00:00:08.447 --> 00:00:09.416
The ride didn't.

00:00:09.723 --> 00:00:11.349
Everyone thought someone else had it.

00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:13.295
Everyone has part of the story.

00:00:13.758 --> 00:00:14.805
Meet Carestead.

00:00:15.099 --> 00:00:16.583
A shared place for care.

00:00:17.028 --> 00:00:19.325
The plan, people, and follow-through.

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:21.000
A clear next step.

00:00:21.307 --> 00:00:23.101
A caregiver in control.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.816
A clear handover.

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.046
Less time chasing updates.

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:28.656
More time being there.

00:00:29.084 --> 00:00:31.613
Just ten minutes from you can mean so much to

00:00:31.623 --> 00:00:33.082
someone who needs support.

00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:34.300
Carestead.

00:00:34.581 --> 00:00:37.019
Less to carry, more care to give.
